==== hyperbricks yaml {!{api_render}} ====
api_render:
  - type: api_render
  - endpoint: https://example.com/api
  - method: GET
  - forwardtoken: account_session
==== explainer ====
Exact incoming cookie name to forward as Bearer. Omitted or empty disables forwarding. String only; mutually exclusive with other authentication sources
==== expected json ====
